# A land play that a replacement sends elsewhere is still a land play (CR 305.1, 614.1): Bot1 plays Dryad Arbor from the
# graveyard by Serra Paragon's "once during each of your turns" permission, and Containment Priest ("If a nontoken
# creature would enter the battlefield and it wasn't cast, exile it instead") exiles it as it is played. The once is
# spent: Ornithopter can't then be cast from the graveyard that turn. On turn 5 it is (the control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Faithless Looting
Serra Paragon
Containment Priest
Plains
Dryad Arbor
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

